  "articleBody": "Thinking about making a tiny home your main residence? It's a fantastic idea for many, but it really boils down to how you live. Zen Tiny Homes specializes in custom designs that fit *your* lifestyle, not just shrinking a regular house. We're talking about purposeful living where every square foot works for you. Whether you cook a lot, work from home, or love to entertain, your primary tiny home needs to reflect that. We consider everything from storage solutions to flexible living areas to ensure it feels personal, usable, and complete. It's about designing around your daily life, making sure your home supports what you do. Don't just settle for a small house; get a smart home that truly enhances your living experience. If you’re ready to explore how a custom tiny home can perfectly suit your primary residence needs, let's chat about your vision and see how we can make it a reality.",
